  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With satellite sign-ups stalling because of steep decoder fees, Muranishi scrapes together forty-three million yen by raiding an actress's tax-reserve pay, holding back staff wages, and borrowing his young assistant's personal savings.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "それ自腹だよね？大丈夫なの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "契約料これだけ高いとね、私なら手出ないかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "何すか？このお金。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "税金対策でプールしておいたギャラ三千万だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まだ今月払ってない女優とスタッフのギャラはいくらある？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "衛星さえ続ければ、来月倍にして払うことだってできる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "一千万ぐらいですかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あと一千万か。お前、今預金いくらある？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "えっ、預金すか？三百万くらいっすかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "来月倍にして返す。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "はい、分かりました！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あと何か、女優たちの生パンティーとかどうすか？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "それ自腹だよね？大丈夫なの？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You paid that out of your own pocket, right? Are you sure that's okay?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "契約料これだけ高いとね、私なら手出ないかな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With subscription fees this steep, if it were me I wouldn't sign up either.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "何すか？このお金。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is all this cash from?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "税金対策でプールしておいたギャラ三千万だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's thirty million in appearance fees we set aside for tax purposes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まだ今月払ってない女優とスタッフのギャラはいくらある？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How much do we have in unpaid actress and crew wages for this month?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "衛星さえ続ければ、来月倍にして払うことだってできる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As long as we keep the satellite running, next month we can pay them back double.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "reika",
      "t": "一千万ぐらいですかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'About ten million yen, I suppose.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "あと一千万か。お前、今預金いくらある？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That leaves ten million. Hey—how much do you have in your savings right now?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "えっ、預金すか？三百万くらいっすかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait, my personal savings? Around three million yen, I guess.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "来月倍にして返す。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'll pay it back double next month.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "はい、分かりました！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, sir—understood!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "student",
      "t": "あと何か、女優たちの生パンティーとかどうすか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For the rest, what about selling the actresses.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
